  "tail_recurrence": "For Q=G_(s+1)-u7^2G_s, Delta=K7_(s+1)-K7_s, H=u7^2 lambda_s^2 K6_s-u6^2 lambda_(s+1)^2 K6_(s+1), M=2s-14. For s>=26, merge r=0,1,2; all later layers are positive Delta layers.",
